	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_00e1a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance called Meglass in order'
	R
	'to ask about Kesselring.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, let’s get right to'
	R
	'the point.'
	R
	'You know Kesselring?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass silently nodded.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'How can he be beaten?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, say something...'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'His coffin.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'He should have a coffin'
	R
	'somewhere... Destroy it.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm... Coffin, huh?'
	R
	'Good work.'
	R
	'You may leave.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00dc7:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass wordlessly flew away'
	R
	'from Rance.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t really care, but he'
	R
	'really doesn’t talk much...'
