	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_00e1a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was waiting for Meglass.'
	R
	'It had been a while, but he'
	R
	'still hadn’t appeared.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Where is he?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	R
	'He’s disobeying my order.'
	R
	'Have him killed.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'...I think it may be possible'
	R
	'that he doesn’t know you'
	R
	'called him.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Why?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass seems to spend all day'
	R
	'flying through the sky, so...'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Just yell at him really loud.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'He’s too high in the sky for'
	R
	'us to be able to contact him.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Man... This is why I hate'
	R
	'demons. I just don’t get them!'
	R
	'He’s just screwing around.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance... Would you like'
	R
	'to lick a sugar cube?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m agitated, but I’m not a'
	R
	'horse. Hmph!!'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'Heh...'
	R
	'I’ll bring you some tea, then.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
