	'Meglass’s back.'
	\L_00e1a:
	ZH 1:
	'He was really fast, like a'
	R
	'roller coaster. It was fun!'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'...Huh, I want to try too.'
	R
	'Call Meglass.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00dc7:
	!VAR0516 : 447!
	\L_00db9:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'At Rance’s order, Meglass'
	R
	'appeared before the throne.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass didn’t so much as bow.'
	R
	'He only hovered silently,'
	R
	'folding his arms.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d11:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm, I can never tell what'
	R
	'he’s thinking.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, whatever. Let me ride'
	R
	'you through the sky.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass didn’t react at all.'
	R
	'It was unclear whether he even'
	R
	'heard Rance.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'.........'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, can you hear me?'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d65:
	ZH 1:
	'...Not for men.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00dc7:
	\L_00d9d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜zoom）'
	\L_00e1a:
	ZH 1:
	'Meglass quickly disappeared'
	R
	'before Rance’s eyes.'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00cf5:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh...'
	\L_00e1a:
	ZH 1:
	'I didn’t want to ride on a'
	R
	'man’s back anyway!'
	R
	'Keh!!!!'
	\L_00e1a:
	\L_00e0d:
	\L_00d2d:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance looked up into the sky'
	R
	'Meglass disappeared into and'
	R
	'yelled profanities.'
